{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"جامع الترمذي","section":{"2":"The Book on Salat (Prayer)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":149,"hadithnumber_last":451,"arabicnumber_first":149,"arabicnumber_last":451,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":341,"arabicnumber":341,"text":"حدثنا هناد، حدثنا وكيع، عن سفيان، عن عبد الله بن دينار، عن ابن عمر، قال كانوا ركوعا في صلاة الصبح . قال ابو عيسى وحديث ابن عمر حديث صحيح","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Agreed Upon"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":193}}]}